---
layout: layouts/base.njk
fullTitle: "Manual Play ➣ Human-powered music discovery"
socialTitle: "Manual Play: Human-powered music discovery"
---
  <header class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 p-16 bg-cream">
    {% set discSize = 180 %}{% set discClass = "size-[180px] rounded-[40px]" %}
    {% include "spin-disc.njk" %}
    
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold uppercase [font-stretch:75%]">{{ site.name }}</h1>
      <p class="font-light text-xl">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
    </div>
    
    {% include "testflight-badge.njk" %}
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pt-20 text-center" aria-label="Introduction">
      <p class="text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-balance sm:text-3xl">
        Manual Play makes it easy to discover great music from the writers, blogs, and magazines you already love.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- FLAG: Replace each placeholder <div> with an <img> of a screenshot, e.g.
         <img src="/images/screenshots/releases.png" width="1290" height="2796" alt="…" class="w-full rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line"> -->
    <section id="screenshots" class="scroll-mt-14 pt-16" aria-label="Screenshots">
      <!-- Scrolls sideways; the padding lines the first screenshot up with the page content above -->
      <ul
        tabindex="0"
        aria-label="Screenshots, scroll sideways for more"
        class="flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-6 overflow-x-auto px-[max(1.5rem,calc((100%_-_64rem)/2_+_1.5rem))] pb-4 scroll-px-[max(1.5rem,calc((100%_-_64rem)/2_+_1.5rem))] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink"
      >
        <li class="w-56 shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-64">
          <figure>
            <div class="flex aspect-[9/19.5] items-center justify-center rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-cream text-sm text-muted">Screenshot 1</div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Caption for screenshot 1</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li class="w-56 shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-64">
          <figure>
            <div class="flex aspect-[9/19.5] items-center justify-center rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-cream text-sm text-muted">Screenshot 2</div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Caption for screenshot 2</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li class="w-56 shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-64">
          <figure>
            <div class="flex aspect-[9/19.5] items-center justify-center rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-cream text-sm text-muted">Screenshot 3</div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Caption for screenshot 3</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li class="w-56 shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-64">
          <figure>
            <div class="flex aspect-[9/19.5] items-center justify-center rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-cream text-sm text-muted">Screenshot 4</div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Caption for screenshot 4</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li class="w-56 shrink-0 snap-start sm:w-64">
          <figure>
            <div class="flex aspect-[9/19.5] items-center justify-center rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-cream text-sm text-muted">Screenshot 5</div>
            <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Caption for screenshot 5</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl scroll-mt-14 px-6 py-20" aria-labelledby="features-heading">
      <h2 id="features-heading" class="text-center font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase [font-stretch:75%]">Features</h2>

      <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Built on RSS</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">The old web is alive, baby. Pitchfork, Stereogum, almost any music site—they all publish via RSS, and Manual Play can read their posts.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 3l1.9 5.1L19 10l-5.1 1.9L12 17l-1.9-5.1L5 10l5.1-1.9z"/><path d="M19 17v4M17 19h4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">One tap to listen</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Manual Play magically detects the music releases your sources write about, and lets you listen to them instantly.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M10 8l6 4-6 4z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Browse with any service</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Apple Music is required for in-app playback, but users of any platform can browse in Manual Play and open releases in the app they choose.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0"/><path d="M16 4.6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 6.8M18.5 14a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 3 6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Read the credits, follow rabbit holes</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Why do streaming services bury this information? Manual Play puts it front-and-center. Learn about the people who created the music you love.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="2" y="4" width="12" height="10" rx="1.5"/><path d="M1 18h14"/><rect x="16" y="8" width="6" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Everywhere you listen</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">On iPhone, Mac, Apple Watch, and CarPlay. Your sources and listening history sync through iCloud, so you can pick up where you left off.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <div class="flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-900">
            <svg class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Keep it simple, stupid</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">I’m absolutely tired of subscriptions. I’m tired of likes. I’m tired of “tailored” mixes. Manual Play is just a list of music, drawn from the writers you choose.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- The essay itself is in src/_includes/essay.md -->
    <article id="why" class="hidden scroll-mt-14 border-t border-line px-6 py-20" aria-label="Why I made Manual Play">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose">
        <div class="copy [&>h2:first-child]:mt-0 [&>h2:first-child]:mb-8 [&>h2:first-child]:text-3xl">
          {% renderFile "./src/_includes/essay.md" %}
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-12">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Spencer Tweedy</p>
          <p class="text-muted">Drummer and developer, Chicago</p>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 bg-cream px-6 py-20 text-center" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
      <img
        src="/images/app-icon.png"
        srcset="/images/app-icon.png 1x, /images/app-icon@2x.png 2x"
        width="96"
        height="96"
        alt=""
        class="size-24 rounded-[22px]"
      >

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 id="cta-heading" class="font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase [font-stretch:75%]">Start digging</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-ink/75">It’s free, no account required.</p>
      </div>

    {% include "testflight-badge.njk" %}
    </section>
  </main>
